&lt;div class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-block public-DraftStyleDefault-ltr&quot; data-offset-key=&quot;46mnv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;46mnv-0-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;BakerHicks’ Utilities &amp;amp; Renewables (U&amp;amp;R) team delivers critical infrastructure projects that&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;style_handle__4nndx style_hasReplacements__2Gq83 style_feminine__2TtJP&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;46mnv-1-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt;support&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-offset-key=&quot;46mnv-2-0&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-text=&quot;true&quot;&gt; the UK’s energy transition and essential services, spanning power generation, transmission and distribution, water, and wider industrial utilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
