cp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;you’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; spend time with clients, using your &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;expertise&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; to win new projects as well as deliver them. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; work in multidisciplinary teams that use our labs and computing resources to enable us to deliver ambitious projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;Much of our defence and security work requires security clearance, so we ask for it up front. You &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt;won’t&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;normaltextrun&quot;&gt; work exclusively in that sector, but a genuine interest in it matters to us.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
