description_html:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;About Wolt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;At Wolt, we create technology that brings joy, simplicity and earnings to the neighborhoods of the world. In 2014 we started with delivery of restaurant food. Now we’re building the delivery of (almost) everything and you’ll find us in over 500 cities in 30 countries around the world. In 2022 we joined forces with DoorDash and together we keep on dreaming big and expanding across the globe.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Working at Wolt isn’t always easy, but it’s definitely exciting. Here you’ll learn more, build more, and ship more than in most other companies. You’ll be challenged a lot, but also have a lot of fun on the way. So, if you’re a self-starter with drive and entrepreneurial spirit, this could be the ride of your life.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;jfepdd&quot; data-start=&quot;503&quot; data-end=&quot;516&quot;&gt;Who We Are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;518&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;Global Marts builds the technology behind DoorDash&#39;s own grocery and retail operations across DashMart, Wolt Market, and Deliveroo Hop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;655&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Our systems decide what products our stores stock, how much inventory to purchase, which vendors to source from, how warehouses execute orders, and what prices customers see.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;831&quot; data-end=&quot;1092&quot;&gt;We build everything from forecasting and replenishment systems to vendor management, warehouse execution, labor scheduling, space optimization, and pricing. Our in-house forecasting platform has replaced third-party solutions and now powers production globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;This isn&#39;t a traditional CRUD backend environment. Much of our work involves designing new systems that solve complex operational problems at global scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1094&quot; data-end=&quot;1249&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;11vcmyo&quot; data-start=&quot;1251&quot; data-end=&quot;1268&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1270&quot; data-end=&quot;1426&quot;&gt;As a Senior Backend Engineer, you&#39;ll work primarily with Go or Kotlin and take end-to-end ownership of production systems and complex technical initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;1428&quot; data-end=&quot;1435&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1437&quot; data-end=&quot;2642&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uw0l5v&quot; data-start=&quot;1437&quot; data-end=&quot;1565&quot;&gt;Design, build, and operate backend systems that support inventory, purchasing, warehouse operations, pricing, and fulfillment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1p1pctx&quot; data-start=&quot;1566&quot; data-end=&quot;1700&quot;&gt;Own technical solutions from problem definition and design through implementation, deployment, monitoring, and production operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;5w2mdo&quot; data-start=&quot;1701&quot; data-end=&quot;1822&quot;&gt;Work on data-heavy systems where software engineering meets forecasting, optimization, and operational decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;91ogko&quot; data-start=&quot;1823&quot; data-end=&quot;1925&quot;&gt;Turn complex and sometimes ambiguous business problems into pragmatic, scalable technical solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;10gd5ut&quot; data-start=&quot;1926&quot; data-end=&quot;2057&quot;&gt;Make and influence architectural decisions, balancing scalability, reliability, development speed, and long-term maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1772gwz&quot; data-start=&quot;2058&quot; data-end=&quot;2195&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with engineers, product managers, data scientists, and operations teams to shape solutions and technical direction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12p2fv1&quot; data-start=&quot;2196&quot; data-end=&quot;2301&quot;&gt;Improve the reliability, observability, scalability, and operational excellence of the systems you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;e71nt1&quot; data-start=&quot;2302&quot; data-end=&quot;2427&quot;&gt;Support and raise the engineering standards of the team through technical discussions, code reviews, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c0xwgg&quot; data-start=&quot;2428&quot; data-end=&quot;2642&quot;&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively while applying strong engineering judgment to validate their output, improve development velocity, and identify opportunities where AI can create additional leverage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ueh9pi&quot; data-start=&quot;2644&quot; data-end=&quot;2658&quot;&gt;How We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;3300&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1owhgv3&quot; data-start=&quot;2660&quot; data-end=&quot;2806&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2662&quot; data-end=&quot;2687&quot;&gt;Autonomy &amp;amp; Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Engineers have end-to-end responsibility for their services, from design and implementation to production and on-call.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jubopr&quot; data-start=&quot;2807&quot; data-end=&quot;2995&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2809&quot; data-end=&quot;2827&quot;&gt;Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Architecture and technical direction are shaped together. Senior engineers are expected to contribute actively to decisions and help others arrive at strong solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;16jtq5s&quot; data-start=&quot;2996&quot; data-end=&quot;3139&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;2998&quot; data-end=&quot;3027&quot;&gt;Scalability &amp;amp; Simplicity:&lt;/strong&gt; We value pragmatic solutions that solve today&#39;s problems while providing a sustainable foundation for tomorrow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;83mt93&quot; data-start=&quot;3140&quot; data-end=&quot;3300&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;3142&quot; data-end=&quot;3153&quot;&gt;Impact:&lt;/strong&gt; We work closely with Product, Data Science, and Operations, connecting technical decisions directly to real-world retail and operational outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;bii48p&quot; data-start=&quot;3302&quot; data-end=&quot;3319&quot;&gt;Our Tech Stack&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3321&quot; data-end=&quot;3369&quot;&gt;Our primary backend languages are Go and Kotlin.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3371&quot; data-end=&quot;3508&quot;&gt;We also use Kafka, PostgreSQL, MongoDB, Redis, Snowflake, AWS, Kubernetes, Docker, gRPC, GitHub Actions, and modern cloud infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3510&quot; data-end=&quot;3710&quot;&gt;You don&#39;t need experience with every technology in our stack. We&#39;re more interested in strong backend and distributed systems fundamentals and your ability to learn and make sound technical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3510&quot; data-end=&quot;3710&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;12dbe07&quot; data-start=&quot;3712&quot; data-end=&quot;3738&quot;&gt;Our Humble Expectations&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;3740&quot; data-end=&quot;3772&quot;&gt;We&#39;re looking for engineers who:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;3774&quot; data-end=&quot;5131&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;pbqzv6&quot; data-start=&quot;3774&quot; data-end=&quot;3861&quot;&gt;Have strong experience designing, building, and operating production backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1sb6zfr&quot; data-start=&quot;3862&quot; data-end=&quot;3945&quot;&gt;Have professional experience with Go, Kotlin, or another modern backend language.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;c6vjeb&quot; data-start=&quot;3946&quot; data-end=&quot;4089&quot;&gt;Have experience owning services end-to-end, including design, implementation, deployment, monitoring, reliability, and production operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k5m44e&quot; data-start=&quot;4090&quot; data-end=&quot;4260&quot;&gt;Have strong knowledge of backend and distributed systems fundamentals, including APIs, databases, asynchronous processing, failure handling, testing, and observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;155uv01&quot; data-start=&quot;4261&quot; data-end=&quot;4399&quot;&gt;Are comfortable working with data-heavy systems and technologies such as Kafka, Snowflake, or similar streaming and data infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1n38k5t&quot; data-start=&quot;4400&quot; data-end=&quot;4534&quot;&gt;Can navigate ambiguous problems, break them into actionable steps, make appropriate technical trade-offs, and deliver incrementally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;bedv3e&quot; data-start=&quot;4535&quot; data-end=&quot;4673&quot;&gt;Can influence technical decisions beyond their immediate tasks and collaborate effectively with engineers and cross-functional partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12pmfcf&quot; data-start=&quot;4674&quot; data-end=&quot;4743&quot;&gt;Communicate technical concepts and decisions clearly and concisely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;hsq0s0&quot; data-start=&quot;4744&quot; data-end=&quot;4951&quot;&gt;Use AI-assisted development tools effectively in their everyday engineering workflow while critically evaluating generated solutions and taking full ownership of the resulting code and technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;15sx82r&quot; data-start=&quot;4952&quot; data-end=&quot;5131&quot;&gt;Look for opportunities to use AI to improve engineering productivity and solve problems more effectively, while understanding where human engineering judgment remains essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5133&quot; data-end=&quot;5149&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;5133&quot; data-end=&quot;5149&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5151&quot; data-end=&quot;5204&quot;&gt;Experience in one or more of the following is a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;5206&quot; data-end=&quot;5566&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;14gp6b2&quot; data-start=&quot;5206&quot; data-end=&quot;5286&quot;&gt;Forecasting, optimization, scheduling, recommendation, or decisioning systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1zurb9&quot; data-start=&quot;5287&quot; data-end=&quot;5355&quot;&gt;Grocery, retail, logistics, supply chain, or warehouse technology.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;al0v23&quot; data-start=&quot;5356&quot; data-end=&quot;5432&quot;&gt;ERP, vendor management, procurement, or workforce management integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;eoufu3&quot; data-start=&quot;5433&quot; data-end=&quot;5507&quot;&gt;Replacing third-party or legacy platforms with internally built systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;48it9n&quot; data-start=&quot;5508&quot; data-end=&quot;5566&quot;&gt;High-throughput event-driven or streaming architectures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ca302g&quot; data-start=&quot;5568&quot; data-end=&quot;5583&quot;&gt;Why Join Us?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5585&quot; data-end=&quot;5786&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll help build the technology that powers DoorDash&#39;s global grocery and retail business, solving complex operational challenges across inventory, forecasting, fulfillment, pricing, and supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;5788&quot; data-end=&quot;6032&quot;&gt;You&#39;ll have significant ownership over the systems you build and the opportunity to influence technical direction while working closely with experienced engineers, product managers, data scientists, and operations teams across multiple markets.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6034&quot; data-end=&quot;6176&quot;&gt;📍 This role is based in our tech hub in Helsinki or Stockholm. We work in distributed teams, but may not be able to support fully remote work or relocation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6034&quot; data-end=&quot;6176&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;wyiacj&quot; data-start=&quot;6178&quot; data-end=&quot;6191&quot;&gt;Next Steps&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;6193&quot; data-end=&quot;6309&quot;&gt;We&#39;re reviewing applications on an ongoing basis, so don&#39;t wait to apply. We&#39;ll get back to you as soon as possible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can read more about our recruitment process&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.wolt.com/en/how-we-hire&quot;&gt; here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;iframe src=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/embed/Ncz4s_oBczc&quot; width=&quot;560&quot; height=&quot;314&quot;&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our Commitment to Diversity and Inclusion&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;We’re committed to growing and empowering a more inclusive community within our company, industry, and cities. That’s why we hire and cultivate diverse teams of people from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives. We believe that true innovation happens when everyone has room at the table and the tools, resources, and opportunity to excel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Beware of recruitment scams: DoorDash, Deliveroo, and Wolt will never ask you to pay money or share sensitive financial information during hiring — learn more about our legitimate recruiting process at &lt;span class=&quot;_80om1qgj _1e0c1nu9&quot; data-testid=&quot;smart-link-draggable-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;loader-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot; data-testid=&quot;hover-card-trigger-wrapper&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;_1yt4x7n9 _2rko1ssi _v56415x0 _1e0c1nu9 _16d9qvcn _syaz13af _1rkwglyw _4cvx1w55 _19itia51 _bfhkhp5a _1a3b18uv _4fprglyw _5goinqa1 _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _uizt1kdv _nt751r31 _49pcglyw _1hvw1o36 _1372tlke _7ehiw5lj _1j5pglyw _1di615s3&quot; href=&quot;https://careersatdoordash.com/recruitment-scam-awareness&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-resolved-view&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw _o5721jtm _1nmz9jpi _16d9qvcn _ca0qv77o _u5f31b66 _n3tdv77o _19bv1b66&quot; data-testid=&quot;inline-card-icon-and-title&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;_19itglyw _vchhusvi _r06hglyw&quot;&gt;Recruitment Scam Awareness - DoorDash&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; .&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

